ds4-eval
Run the built-in reasoning, math, science, and security evaluation harness with a live terminal UI.

Usage: ds4-eval [options]

Model And Runtime
  -m, --model FILE               GGUF model path. Default: ds4flash.gguf
  --metal | --cuda | --cpu       Select the backend explicitly.
  --backend NAME                 Backend name: metal, cuda, or cpu.
  --gpu-vram N[,N,...]|auto      CUDA VRAM budgets per device, in GiB, or auto-detect free VRAM.
  --gpu-devices N[,N,...]        CUDA device indices used by multi-GPU placement.
  -c, --ctx N                    Allocated context tokens.
  -t, --threads N                CPU helper threads for host-side/reference work.
  --power N                      GPU duty-cycle target, 1..100. Default: 100
  --ssd-streaming                Metal/CUDA/ROCm: opt in to SSD-backed model streaming instead of full residency.
  --ssd-streaming-cold           SSD streaming: skip default popularity-based expert-cache preload.
  --ssd-streaming-cache-experts N|NGB
      SSD streaming cache target. N requests dynamic expert slots; NGB also reserves two full prefill layers. Either may be reduced to fit the model, graph, context, and backend working set.
  --ssd-streaming-full-layers N  GLM Metal streaming: keep the first N routed layers fully resident. Default: auto from NGB expert budget; use 0 to disable.
  --ssd-streaming-preload-experts N
      SSD streaming: upfront popularity preload count. DeepSeek auto-seeds by default; GLM demand-fills unless N is explicit.
  --simulate-used-memory NGB     Diagnostic: lock N GiB before model load to simulate a smaller-memory machine.
  --prefill-chunk N              Graph prefill chunk size. Default: CUDA TP 2048; PRO long prompts 8192; others 4096.

Evaluation
  --suite NAME                   core, hard, all, or hard-smoke. Default: core
  --source NAME                  Run only cases from this source.
  --domain NAME                  Run only cases in this domain.
  --case-id ID                   Run the case with this source ID.
  --list-cases                   List selected cases without loading a model.
  --validate-cases               Validate all embedded cases and exit.
  -n, --tokens N                 Override the generation budget for every question.
  --questions N                  Run only the first N selected questions.
  --case-sequence LIST           Run 1-based case numbers in this comma-separated order.
  --retry-incomplete             Retry a missing final answer once with twice the budget.
  --trace FILE                   Write questions, outputs, and grading decisions.
  --regrade-trace FILE           Regrade a prior trace without loading the model.
  --soft-limit-reply-budget N    Soft close thinking near the end of reply budget. Default: 1024
  --hard-limit-reply-budget N    Force </think> with N tokens left. Default: 512
  --soft-limit-think-close-rank N
      Soft-close when </think> is in top N tokens. Default: 3
  --pause-ms N                   Pause after each result in the TTY UI. Default: 350
  --plain                        Disable split-screen ANSI UI.
  --self-test-extractors         Run answer-extractor self-tests and exit.

More Info
    Runtime full info:         --help runtime
    Sampling full info:        --help sampling
    Distributed inference:     --help distributed
    Evaluation options:        --help evaluation

Examples
  first 10                       ./ds4-eval --questions 10 --trace eval.trace
  plain                          ./ds4-eval --plain --nothink --tokens 512

